OL,3,GNEWSAWhere is Warrington Council
OL,4,Aplanning #50m of cuts?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarrington Borough Council is planning
OL,7,Fto make cuts worth #51.2m.
OL,9,FA recent scrutiny committee meeting
OL,10,Fgave councillors the opportunity to
OL,11,Fquestion cabinet members and the
OL,12,Fcouncil's executive about the plans.
OL,14,FThe proposals will be discussed by the
OL,15,Fcouncil's cabinet later and again by
OL,16,Fthe full council on 21 September.
OL,18,FWarrington Borough Council built up
OL,19,Fmore than #1.8bn of debt, mostly due to
OL,20,Fits investment programme.
